    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Gemini of the abandoned&quot; is a horror adventure game, played from a third-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story tells that a planet named Ara\u1e47ya in the universe was invaded by humans, the creatures that originally lived on the planet tried their best to resist, but still caused the loss of many lives, player will control the fairy sisters who have been captured alive and help them escape from the dark experimental site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247920/extras/6428144b66803e9312c4260da1750508.avif?t=1753685935\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247920/extras/b5e6d624278f6d1f46b5970d5a655d31.avif?t=1753685935\" /></div>In the process of escaping, will see many purgatory-like scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247920/extras/e835b3b1c620b80486042752cf0770cb.avif?t=1753685935\" /></div>The prosperity of the past is no more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247920/extras/ec4a49836bda4014632330e04af3a7a5.avif?t=1753685935\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Errors that cannot be eliminated:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* If a bug occurs when loading a scene, please to select level and select the next correct level directly, we apologize for the inconvenience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Gemini of the abandoned&quot; is a horror adventure game, played from a third-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story tells that a planet named Ara\u1e47ya in the universe was invaded by humans, the creatures that originally lived on the planet tried their best to resist, but still caused the loss of many lives, player will control the fairy sisters who have been captured alive and help them escape from the dark experimental site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247920/extras/6428144b66803e9312c4260da1750508.avif?t=1753685935\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247920/extras/b5e6d624278f6d1f46b5970d5a655d31.avif?t=1753685935\" /></div>In the process of escaping, will see many purgatory-like scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247920/extras/e835b3b1c620b80486042752cf0770cb.avif?t=1753685935\" /></div>The prosperity of the past is no more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1247920/extras/ec4a49836bda4014632330e04af3a7a5.avif?t=1753685935\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Errors that cannot be eliminated:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* If a bug occurs when loading a scene, please to select level and select the next correct level directly, we apologize for the inconvenience.</p>",
